# Unreleased
* Fix TF-IDF scoring: document frequency, non-negative IDF, and a bounded 20% recency boost
* Fix build crash on sites with a single post
* Ignore query words that are not in the index (e.g. stopwords) and strip punctuation from queries
* Strip Liquid tags from indexed content and excerpts
* Namespace Ruby classes under `JekyllRankedSearch`
* Declare `jekyll` as a runtime dependency
* Add test suite

